---
import Section from "../site/Section.astro"
import Split from "../site/Split.astro"
import ChatFollowUp from "../product/ChatFollowUp.astro"
---

<Section ruled={false}>
  <Split>
    <div slot="start" class="copy">
      <h2 class="h2">Observe Agent, on the model you configure.</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        Observe Agent is built in and runs on the model you set on the server: Anthropic, or any OpenAI-compatible server, including
        one you run yourself. The Agents page shows whether it is on, which provider and model it uses, and its runs, failures, cost
        and median wait over the last seven days.
      </p>
      <p class="lead">
        What its tools return goes to that provider, so choose one whose data handling fits your data. The chat shows the steps the
        tools report and the result, not the model's own text.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div slot="end" data-in-view="rise">
      <ChatFollowUp />
    </div>
  </Split>
</Section>

<style>
  .copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .copy .lead {
    font-size: 17px;
  }
</style>
